Commonly Used Spring Boot Starters
1. Spring Web Starter
spring-boot-starter-web
Used for:
•	REST APIs
•	Web Applications
•	MVC Applications
________________________________________
2. Spring Data JPA Starter
spring-boot-starter-data-jpa
Automatically includes:
•	Hibernate
•	JPA Support
•	Transaction Management
Used for database operations.
________________________________________
3. Spring Security Starter
spring-boot-starter-security
Provides:
•	Authentication
•	Authorization
•	Security Filters
Used to secure applications.
________________________________________
4. Spring Boot Test Starter
spring-boot-starter-test
Provides:
•	JUnit
•	Mockito
•	Spring Testing Support
Used for unit and integration testing.
________________________________________
5. Spring Actuator Starter
spring-boot-starter-actuator
Provides:
•	Health Checks
•	Metrics
•	Monitoring Endpoints
Used for production monitoring.
