How to Check Included Dependencies?
Use the Maven Dependency Tree:
mvn dependency:tree
This command displays all dependencies brought in by a starter.
For example:
spring-boot-starter-web
│
├── spring-web
├── spring-webmvc
├── jackson-databind
├── tomcat-embed-core
└── spring-boot-starter
This helps developers understand what is included behind the scenes.
